VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT aftershock.cycle-traceability
GOAL
  Every declared business cycle has an explicit, checked note, source and critic linkage.
CLAIM cycle-links REQUIRED
  ENSURE business cycle identities, deposited notes, source URLs and critic records agree with an owner-reviewed link manifest
VERIFY cycle-links
  USING aftershock.links
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
